            "line": 99,
            "column": 29
          },
          "text": " when no recording is active. Designed for\nUI-rate polling — a 60–100 ms interval is a good starting point for a\nwaveform. Avoid calling it in a tight loop; each call crosses the\nJS/native bridge."
        }
      ]
